{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066258/block/singleImage/3281019/df/01M8GQ1904Q03CGWTS3B3T0JV1.jpeg?updatedAt=1795857506\"/><figcaption>大埔天鑽一房以510萬元易手。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產大埔嵐山分行經理楊頌堯表示，分行最新錄得大埔天鑽9座低層F室成交，單位實用面積約372方呎，一房間隔，日前議價後以510萬元沽出，呎價約13,710元。 據了解，新買家為同區租客，近日決定轉租為買，見單位價錢合理，間隔合用，即入市單位自用。原業主於2019年以556萬元購入單位，持貨約7年轉手，帳面損失46萬元，物業期內貶值約8.3%。 資料顯示，天鑽位於大埔半山山塘路8號，2020年入伙，共有17座，提供1,620伙。 即睇大埔天鑽放盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:38:34.309538+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:57.200848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:31:59.316722+00:00","content_hash":"0e21d4ecb525cd95808c79dbf136f8e3eb8bbc19cad98eaaa3a4f23fcf260f5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:38:34.309538+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}